{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>\n昨晚（28日）TVB節目《璀璨之城》另一MVP張智霖（Chilam）演技大爆發！Chilam飾演的官孝賢徹底黑化，展現出「恐怖份子」級別的霸道氣場，其職場毒舌金句更引發網民共鳴，一句「框框」更成功洗腦，究竟他還會有多心狠手辣？\n</p>\n<h2>張智霖冰鋒眼神嚇人 捏高海寧下巴逼就範</h2>\n<p>張智霖在劇中氣場全開，無論是在辦公室逼迫一眾董事，或是在家中向高海寧（高Ling）施壓，都展現出非一般的霸道與專制。他時而以冷酷無情的「冰鋒眼神」令人不寒而慄，時而激動拍枱破口大罵，甚至使出捏著下屬Alice（高海寧飾）下巴逼其就範的狠招，其「恐怖份子」級別的演繹，讓觀眾看得心驚膽顫，完全演活了孝賢的黑化過程。</p>\n<h2>官孝賢職場毒舌金句 網民大嘆有共鳴</h2>\n<p>雖然孝賢的手段專制，但他擲地有聲的「上級金句」卻意外地引發不少上班族網民的共鳴，認為上司希望下屬有貢獻實屬合情合理。劇中他對下屬的毒舌金句包括：「我唔係要你哋話得定唔得,你哋係要話我知點先至為之得」、「你淨係識得附和，同出面 reception 有乜分別？」句句到肉，讓不少打工仔表示感同身受。</p>\n<h2>「框框」二字瘋狂洗腦 網民笑言滿腦都是</h2>\n<p>全晚高潮之一，必定是Chilam教訓高Ling的一場戲。他不斷以陰聲細氣、充滿壓迫感的語氣重覆「框框」二字，成功製造出極強的洗腦效果：「我唔係尋求緊你法律意見，我係要你跳出個框框去諗辦法」、「有時唔單止法律嘅框框，甚至乎道德嘅框框，倫理嘅框框」、「我唔理用咩方法，你同我搞掂佢，就算犧牲你自己，I don’t care」。此幕播出後，大量網民笑言被瘋狂洗腦，整個腦袋都是「框框」！</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/45_5104913796ae2dcc9bda61.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/45_5104913796ae2dcc9bda61.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/46_7073533676ae2dcccce782.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/46_7073533676ae2dcccce782.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/47_3224528376ae2dccf84a28.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/47_3224528376ae2dccf84a28.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/48_14523901986ae2dcd2741bb.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/48_14523901986ae2dcd2741bb.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_7863656466ae2dc95dea16.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/28_7863656466ae2dc95dea16.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_17802306696ae2dc98848b7.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/29_17802306696ae2dc98848b7.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_21122190096ae2dc9b8ee08.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/30_21122190096ae2dc9b8ee08.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_5283472476ae2dc9e58f39.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/31_5283472476ae2dc9e58f39.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_6407593766ae2dca1604d1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/32_6407593766ae2dca1604d1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_3384433766ae2dca41423e.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/33_3384433766ae2dca41423e.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_21011937436ae2dca7cb10a.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"璀璨之城 張智霖 （圖片來源：TVB）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/10/34_21011937436ae2dca7cb10a.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：TVB）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-29T08:01:24.349592+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1002,"images":11,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-29T07:52:11+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-29T10:18:46.287465+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-29T07:58:32.833311+00:00","content_hash":"93efa982406f14c5a9d6212ba77fb21342a4c55a06dcb40b005aeba0b286ab4b","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}